zy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Hydra%20Tongue\"><img alt=\"Hydra Tongue\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Hydra_Tongue_a9a7ba.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Hydra%20Tongue\">Hydra Tongue</a><sup>1</sup></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">100 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Indoor Plant\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Indoor_Plant_6a0e7c.gif\" width=\"42\"/></span></td><td>Indoor Plant</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">8 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Potted Flower\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Potted_Flower_ec3e4e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td>Potted Flower</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">5 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"item-notes\"><b>Notes:</b><ol><li id=\"w-notes-1\">By saying <i>(sell/buy) item name</i>.</li></ol></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Rose.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Rose</strong>: Welcome to <a href=\"#/wiki/Crunor%27s%20Finest%20Warehouse\">Crunor's Finest Warehouse</a>, <i>Player</i>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nRose: My name is Rose, nice to meet you, <i>Player</i>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>time</b><br/>\nRose: Sorry, I have no watch on me.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Rose</b><br/>\nRose: That's me. I am not for sale. &lt;giggles&gt;<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nRose: Here you may buy some of the most beautiful flowers.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>flowers</b> or <b>plants</b><br/>\nRose: I offer indoor plants, flower bowls, god flowers, honey flowers and potted flowers. What do you need?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>buy hydra tongue</b><br/>\nRose: Oh of course. Come on. As if I were to believe that you want to buy a pest plant. Well, you really want to buy a hydra tongue for 50 gold?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nRose: You ... what ...? Erm, I mean, did I say 50 gold? I meant 100 gold! Do you want to buy this precious and rare hydra tongue for 100 gold?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nRose: Incredible ... I mean the beauty of the rare herb you just bought. Have as much fun with the plant as I will have with your 100 gold.<br/><br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nRose: Good bye.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Rose</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["the-ice-islands-quest"],"pos":{"x":32971,"y":32034,"z":6}}